Scope limits — read before reusing
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. **Derived quantities only.**  Nothing here is a redistribution of the
   primary data.  ERA5 (Copernicus CDS), GLORYS12V1 (CMEMS), IBTrACS (NOAA
   NCEI) and HURSAT-B1 v07b (NOAA NCEI) remain governed by their own terms;
   only storm-centred derived quantities computed from them are published.
   Raw field archives (`data/phase1/raw/**`), the raw HURSAT frame store
   (`data/global_hursat/frames*`) and the RITCF feature caches
   (`era5.npy`, `sat.npy`) are deliberately not included; the scripts that
   rebuild them are in `scripts/01_data/` and `scripts/ritcf_recon/`.

2. **Model weights are not part of this license.**  Trained checkpoints are
   not redistributed, and the external `LingBot` backbone keeps its own
   license.  Every reported metric is nevertheless recomputable from the
   frozen predictions shipped here.

